Conjures up a bolt of lightning, doing [57, 77, 92, 105, 117 (TL1-5; SP 100)] to [172, 231, 277, 316, 351 (TL1-5; SP 100)] damage ([114, 154, 185, 211, 234 (TL1-5; SP 100)] average) and dazing the target for 3 turns.

If the target resists the daze effect it is instead shocked, which halves stun/daze/pin resistance, for 5 turns.

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
